    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but changing my reaction doesn't change the reality. i'm still stuck in the same house, with the same people, living the same life. it doesn't matter how i react, the walls are still there. sometimes i just think... what if the only real way to actually be free, to truly be nothing but myself without anyone else's hands on me, is to just leave it all behind? like, to just escape completely so the walls can't touch me anymore.",
